# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.netkill).
# The container layout behind the dead10cc kill, then the kill itself: Wi-Fi joined by the scene,
# Sileo opened with the network on, /var and /var/jb looked at, Sileo killed with SIGKILL by
# killby, and opened again by URL. The runner is devices/thyme/launchtest.sh
# (SCENE=out/thyme-boot/root-netkill.apfs), a screenshot every two seconds.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 6
/redwood/bin/net_test joinfile /redwood/fw/network
/redwood/bin/net_test waitaddr en0 60 resolve apt.procurs.us
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen sileo://package/tree
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30
/var/jb/usr/bin/ls -ld /var /var/mobile /var/jb /var/jb/var /var/jb/var/mobile
/redwood/bin/killby Sileo
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 8
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen sileo://package/tree
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 40
